                            We focus on keeping the platform
                            easy to understand, even for
                            first-time users.

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="why-item">

                    <div class="why-number">
                        02
                    </div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>
                            Competitive prices
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            We work toward providing
                            affordable services so our
                            customers can get more value.

                        </p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <div class="why-item">

                    <div class="why-number">
                        03
                    </div>

                    <div>

                        <h3>
                            Built for speed
                        </h3>

                        <p>

                            From funding your wallet to
                            purchasing services, we want
                            every step to feel quick and smooth.

                        </p>

